m of  course i'm saying this from the point of  view of having already paid back my  student loans and like having savings in  my bank account so maybe if that wasn't  the case i wouldn't even be thinking  like this  um  i mean like experience is kind of a  privileged concept right i'm definitely  happy with my choices because i really  like what i'm doing and i'm really happy  about where i'm at  but i have been observing  that my values have been shifting as i  get older  especially when it comes to  money and time  i think when i was a little bit younger  i was willing to trade my time and  experiences for money  or for the ability to make money faster  but now  i would much rather have more time  and more experiences  and  more  opportunity for learning over money but  i think this is totally normal  we change our circumstances change and  our priorities change inevitably  i think we just have to be mindful of  that and be flexible and also try to  make room in our days to reflect  and think about our values and where we  want to be in the future  anyways i would really love to know  where you are in your journey right now  and where you want to be in the next  three years let me know in the comments  below i can't wait to hear from you and  yeah thanks for watching  you


